Entertainment Japan"},{"animation":false,"id":119,"name":"Viz Media"},{"animation":false,"id":127,"name":"Yomiko Advertising"}],"synopsis":{"language":null,"source":"anilist","spoiler":false,"text":"The story begins when high school student Kazuki Muto is killed one night saving a mysterious girl from a monster, only to wake up in his school dorm, believing it to have been a dream. However, he soon finds out that dream wasn't a dream at all when a giant serpentine monster attacks him and his sister. Tokiko Tsumura, the girl he saved, explains that the monster is a homunculus. Kazuki had been attacked and killed by it when he was rescuing her. However, she, feeling responsible for him, revived him by placing a Kakugane medallion in his chest, serving as a replacement heart.\n\nThe Kakugane, as Tokiko explains, is an alchemical device that, when activated, takes a certain form based on the Kakugane's user, forming a unique Buso Renkin. The Buso Renkin is the only thing that can destroy a homunculus monster. Using this, Kazuki creates his own Buso Renkin (the \"Sunlight Heart\", a huge lance). Along with Tokiko and her own Buso Renkin (the \"Valkyrie Skirt\", an execution scythe), Kazuki joins the fight against the homunculi and their master."},"tags":[{"name":"School","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Shounen","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":79,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Magic","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Alchemy","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tomboy","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Chimera","rank":60,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Twins","rank":53,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Love Triangle","rank":20,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Space","rank":20,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Incest","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Arms Alchemy","english":"Arms Alchemy","native":"武装錬金","romaji":"Busou Renkin","synonyms":[{"language":"z